filament_notes = "Yasin3D PETG at 0.8 nozzle - no vendor data sheet exists.\n\nWHAT IS ACTUALLY KNOWN: the vendor, the material type, 1.75 mm, and the price. Everything else - 250 C print / 240 C first layer, 85/90 C bed, 30-50 % fan, 20 mm3/s, density 1.27 - is inherited from Prusa's Generic PETG @0.8 nozzle.\n\nPRICE: 39 ILS incl. VAT, product 'PETG Yasin3D 1KG' at filamentcenter.co.il (checked 29 Aug 2026).\n\nWORTH KNOWING BEFORE THE FIRST PRINT: the inherited bed is 85 C first layer / 90 C, hot enough for PETG to bond to a smooth PEI sheet strongly enough to damage it. Use the textured sheet, a glue-stick release layer, or a lower bed.\n\nUNTESTED - no calibration print has been run with this profile yet."
